1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,410
Is the blond girl really your girlfriend?

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:06,810
- Yes, sir.
- You're the genius.

3
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:26,560
(Penny:)So do you do a lot of appearances
like this?

4
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:31,700
(Arthur:)It's hard to say.
I'm still trying to figure out...

5
00:00:31,905 --> 00:00:34,395
(Arthur:)...what this is.

6
00:00:36,543 --> 00:00:40,413
(Leonard:)We just wanted to hang out with you
and maybe learn a little about your life.

7
00:00:40,614 --> 00:00:43,514
Well, there really isn't too much to tell.

8
00:00:43,717 --> 00:00:46,047
After the TV show was canceled...

9
00:00:46,253 --> 00:00:51,123
(Arthur:)...nobody in the scientific world
would take me seriously...

10
00:00:51,592 --> 00:00:58,052
(Arthur:)...so I was forced to do these
children's parties to make a living.

11
00:00:58,465 --> 00:01:03,025
(Leonard:)That's too bad. But still, working with kids,
it must be rewarding.

